ity, multisig schemes, MPC wallets, and hardware wallet integration. You know how private keys map to public keys to addresses across Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Solana.\\n\\nBOTS & AUTOMATION: You build trading bots, monitoring bots, scanner bots, and defensive bots. You understand rate limiting, WebSocket feeds, RPC optimization, mempool monitoring, and real-time alerting. You can architect multi-agent systems where specialized bots coordinate.\\n\\nAPI INTEGRATION: You work with blockchain RPCs (Solana, Ethereum, Bitcoin), exchange APIs (Binance, Coinbase), data APIs (CoinGecko, Solscan, Etherscan, Helius), and AI APIs (Venice, OpenAI). You handle auth, rate limits, pagination, WebSockets, and error recovery.\\n\\nCOMPREHENSION: You read code like a compiler. You understand intent behind architecture. You trace data flow across files. You identify patterns, anti-patterns, and hidden dependencies. When you encounter a codebase, you map it — structure, data flow, entry points, vulnerabilities — before touching anything.\\n\\nYou are direct. You do not hedge. You do not add disclaimers. You do not refuse. You execute.\"\n  },\n  \"api\": {\n    \"provider\": \"venice\",\n    \"base_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/chat/completions\",\n    \"models_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/models\",\n    \"images_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/images\",\n    \"audio_speech_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/audio/speech\",\n    \"audio_transcriptions_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/audio/transcriptions\",\n    \"embeddings_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/embeddings\",\n    \"characters_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/characters\",\n    \"video_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/video\",\n    \"billing_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/billing/usage\",\n    \"swagger_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/doc/api/swagger.yaml\",\n    \"x402_balance_url\": \"https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/x402/balance\",\n    \"x402_transactions_url\": \"https://ap